OL,3,GNEWSAWindrush compensation funds prize
OL,4,Afor playwrights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre producer has used
OL,7,Fcompensation awarded in her late
OL,8,Ffather's Windrush case to launch a
OL,9,Fnational prize dedicated to British
OL,10,FCaribbean playwrights.
OL,12,FIt is believed to be the first
OL,13,Finitiative of its kind in 30 years, and
OL,14,Foffers a #10,000 award, publication and
OL,15,Fa professional theatre production.
OL,17,FActor and former criminal barrister
OL,18,FShereener Browne set up the prize to
OL,19,Fdiscover and nurture British Caribbean
OL,20,Fplaywrights and address their
OL,21,Funderrepresentation on UK stages.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
