OL,3,GNEWSAWindrush compensation funds prize
OL,4,Afor playwrights
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "It was borne out of a great
OL,7,Finjustice suffered by my late father
OL,8,Fand others from the Caribbean, so I
OL,9,Fhonour his memory by creating a prize
OL,10,Fto elevate our stories, create
OL,11,Fopportunities and effect lasting
OL,12,Fchange."
